    "160": {
        "id": "160",
        "title": "ECONOMIC TRENDS RESEARCH TEAM",
        "description": "Teams will apply economic principles to analyze global and domestic trends, conduct research using credible sources, and present evidence-based solutions in both a paper and a presentation. Core competencies assessed include, but are not limited to, Apply foundational economic concepts to analyze and interpret global and domestic economic trends; Conduct rigorous economic research using credible sources and communicate findings clearly and professionally through oral presentations and written reports.",
