    "165": {
        "id": "165",
        "title": "PERSONAL FINANCIAL MANAGEMENT",
        "description": "Contestants will showcase personal finance expertise by analyzing credit, taxes, investments, insurance, and retirement strategies while applying risk management, consumer protection concepts, and financial calculations to solve real-world scenarios. Core competencies assessed include, but are not limited to, Explain the functions of key regulatory agencies in overseeing financial institutions and protecting consumers, emphasizing compliance and ethical standards; Analyze credit agreements, costs, and regulatory protections to make informed borrowing decisions.",
