    "225": {
        "id": "225",
        "title": "ADMINISTRATIVE SUPPORT TEAM (DEDICATED TO THE MEMORY OF DEBORAH PAUL)",
        "description": "Teams will learn to use industry-standard software for word processing, spreadsheets, databases, presentations, and publishing to create professional materials and streamline workflows. Core competencies assessed include, but are not limited to, Utilize industry-standard software for word processing, database management, spreadsheets, presentations, and desktop publishing to organize and merge data, analyze information, and create professional business materials across multiple applications to ens ure efficiency; Demonstrate leadership and teamwork by evaluating tasks, delegating responsibilities, and managing priorities and timelines to optimize workflow and achieve organizational goals.",
        "wsapLink": "#",
