    "292": {
        "id": "292",
        "title": "PROJECT MANAGEMENT CONCEPTS (OPEN)",
        "description": "Contestants will assess understanding of universal project management concepts and practices aligned with nationally recognized project management standards, including the Project Management Institute (PMI) PMBOK\u00ae Guide . Core competencies assessed include, but are not limited to, Understand project life cycles, phases, organizational structures, and essential project management terminology; Understand work breakdown structures (WBS) and how they support planning, scheduling, and task management.",
