        "id": "293",
        "title": "MEETING AND EVENT PLANNING CONCEPTS (OPEN)",
        "description": "Contestants will demonstrate understanding of the core principles and practices of professional meeting and event management. Core competencies assessed include, but are not limited to, Plan and manage all aspects of an event project by organizing tasks, timelines, and resources; Recruit, schedule, and train staff or volunteers to support event operations.",
