    "320": {
        "id": "320",
        "title": "COMPUTER SECURITY",
        "description": "Contestants will demonstrate foundational knowledge of security management across Windows\u00ae and Linux\u00ae networking environments. Core competencies assessed include, but are not limited to, Identify, assess, and mitigate security threats by deploying layered security tactics and managing inbound connections to prevent, detect, and respond to attacks; Develop, implement, and manage infrastructure security controls and organizational security policies to safeguard networks, systems, and data while ensuring compliance.",
