        "description": "Teams will analyze existing and proposed business environments and develop a comprehensive strategy for implementing a network infrastructure that meets the organization\u2019s needs. Core competencies assessed include, but are not limited to, Design, implement, and optimize network solutions, including routing strategies and VPNs, to meet organizational requirements for performance, security, and scalability; Design and document network cable topologies and create detailed network diagrams using industry-standard tools to support communication, troubleshooting, and future planning.",
