    "330": {
        "id": "330",
        "title": "C# PROGRAMMING",
        "description": "Contestants will demonstrate practical knowledge of C# development, including core syntax, programming logic, application design, and use of objects, data access, and IDE tools within a Windows environment. Core competencies assessed include, but are not limited to, Apply object-oriented programming principles and structured design techniques, along with efficient algorithms, to design, implement, and maintain scalable, reusable software solutions; Demonstrate foundational understanding of computer science concepts and proficiency in at least one modern programming language.",
