        "description": "Contestants will demonstrate foundational knowledge of computer programming concepts, including languages, logic, algorithm design, data structures, and core software development principles. Core competencies assessed include, but are not limited to, Demonstrate foundational understanding of computer science principles, including logic, data structures, and algorithms, and demonstrate proficiency in modern programming languages with adaptability to others as needed; Design and implement efficient algorithms using structured and object-oriented design techniques to create scalable and maintainable software solutions.",
