l_Media_Pro_Technical_Rubric_S_2022.pdf"}, {"name": "420_Digital_Media_Production_Presentation_Rubric_2019.pdf", "url": "PracticeTests\\2019 State & National Tests\\2019 S-PS National Tests\\400s\\420_Digital_Media_Production_Presentation_Rubric_2019.pdf"}, {"name": "420_Digital_Media_Production_Technical_Rubric_2019.pdf", "url": "PracticeTests\\2019 State & National Tests\\2019 S-PS National Tests\\400s\\420_Digital_Media_Production_Technical_Rubric_2019.pdf"}, {"name": "420_N_Digital Media Production Technical Rubric 2024.pdf", "url": "PracticeTests\\2024-State and National Tests\\2024 National Tests\\400s DIGITAL COMMUNICATION & DESIGN\\420-Digital Media Production\\420_N_Digital Media Production Technical Rubric 2024.pdf"}, {"name": "420_N_Digital Media Production_Presentation_Rubric_2024.pdf", "url": "PracticeTests\\2024-State and National Tests\\2024 National Tests\\400s DIGITAL COMMUNICATION & DESIGN\\420-Digital Media Production\\420_N_Digital Media Production_Presentation_Rubric_2024.pdf"}, {"name": "420_S_Digital Media Production Technical Rubric 2024.pdf", "url": "PracticeTests\\2024-State and National Tests\\2024 State Tests\\400_s DIGITAL COMMUNICATION & DESIGN\\420 Digital Media Production\\420_S_Digital Media Production Technical Rubric 2024.pdf"}, {"name": "420_S_Digital Media Production_Presentation_Rubric_2024.pdf", "url": "PracticeTests\\2024-State and National Tests\\2024 State Tests\\400_s DIGITAL COMMUNICATION & DESIGN\\420 Digital Media Production\\420_S_Digital Media Production_Presentation_Rubric_2024.pdf"}],
        "generatorLink": "#"
    },
    "425": {
        "id": "425",
        "title": "3D COMPUTER MODELING",
        "description": "Contestants will research, design, prototype, and create a 3D model or scene based on the provided topic. Core competencies assessed include, but are not limited to, Create comprehensive profiles for characters, environments, or objects and demonstrate iterative development through research, concept art, digital prototyping, and refinement using collaborative platforms and version control.; Apply finishing, lighting, and texturing techniques using modern 3D software and design precise geometric models to meet technical and aesthetic requirements..",
        "wsapLink": "#",
