    "440": {
        "id": "440",
        "title": "3D COMPUTER ANIMATION TEAM",
        "description": "Contestants will create a 3D computer animation, not to exceed two (2:00) minutes, based on the assigned topic. Core competencies assessed include, but are not limited to, Utilize industry-standard editing and 3-D animation software and develop animations through storyboarding and scripting tools to ensure clear narrative structure, timing, and alignment with project objectives; Apply color grading, realistic textures, and dynamic special effects using modern digital tools to enhance visual impact, depth, and storytelling in multimedia projects.",
