    "445": {
        "id": "445",
        "title": "BROADCAST NEWS PRODUCTION TEAM",
        "description": "Contestants will create a three to five (3:00-5:00) minute news broadcast on the assigned topic. Core competencies assessed include, but are not limited to, Utilize industry-standard broadcast software, hardware, and workflows to plan, capture, and edit high-quality broadcast content, integrating nonlinear editing techniques and strategic use of B-roll to enhance storytelling and production value; Create and refine broadcast scripts and scripting techniques to craft compelling, concise, and audience-focused stories.",
