    "490": {
        "id": "490",
        "title": "ARTS, ENTERTAINMENT, & DESIGN CONCEPTS (OPEN)",
        "description": "Contestants will assess knowledge of animation, digital media, desktop publishing and web design languages. Core competencies assessed include, but are not limited to, Apply core visual design principles \u2014 including layout, hierarchy, balance, alignment, contrast, and spacing \u2014 to create clear, effective, and audience-appropriate visual communications across digital media; Select and apply typography and color strategically to enhance readability, brand consistency, accessibility, and visual impact, following industry best practices.",
